<title>POLAND: NFI units close higher in live trade.</title>
<headline>NFI units close higher in live trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish mass privatisation NFI units closed at 112.5 zlotys, 7.1 percent higher than their opening price, in Warsaw bourse continuous trade.</p>
<p>Rolimpex closed flat at 120 zlotys.</p>
<p>BIG, BPH, Debica and Elektrim did not trade.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
